window.EN={"1":"Having taken Norden, Leif's \"Liberation Army\" at last reaches the east gate of Leonster.","2":"But there, an army greater than the one at Fort Norden lay in wait for Leif and his forces.","3":"Nikalaf, have the rebels still not been dealt with!","4":"Sir...","5":"Because of Kempf's selfish actions, we missed our chance for victory... My apologies!","6":"Kh... that Kempf... repaying kindness with spite!","7":"As you said, that man should have been sent back home.","8":"No, I was too lenient. But there is no longer any need to worry.","9":"Before the castle are my armored knights and Bishop Moore's mage corps.","10":"To the enemy's rear, Reinhardt's Gelben Ritter.","11":"And further, as reserve forces, I have the Silessean pegasus knights standing by.","12":"With this much strength, we can defeat any enemy whatsoever.","13":"I see... Well, it is you saying it, General. There should be no mistake.","14":"And I forgot to mention, I am told Father Saias will be stopping by.","15":"He is in the middle of a journey, but it seems he will lend us his strength.","16":"That genius strategist, Sir Saias? Is that true!?","17":"According to the message, he should arrive in a few more hours.","18":"Understood.","19":"Then we will first firm up our defense, and as soon as the strategist arrives, launch an offensive all at once.","20":"Marquis Gustav, please await the good news inside the castle.","21":"Mm, I'm counting on you, Nikalaf!","22":"Prince, this is no good. There is not the slightest opening in the enemy's formation.","23":"What do you mean?","24":"The problem is the Silessean mercenary army encamped to the northwest.","25":"If we head for the castle, we will be attacked from behind.","26":"What about splitting our soldiers and having some deal with them?","27":"We have already left half our soldiers behind as a defense against Reinhardt's army in the rear.","28":"Splitting our soldiers any further is not wise.","29":"Then what do we do?","30":"Just how much will to fight does the Silessean mercenary army have... That is the question...","31":"So, do you understand the plan, General Misha?","32":"Understood...","33":"Then I ask that there be no slips. By the way...","34":"Yes?","35":"I heard that your mother was slain in the civil war long ago by the traitor Sigurd. Is that true?","36":"......","37":"And so you volunteered to become a mercenary for the Empire?","38":"My mother has nothing to do with it.","39":"We are working to save the starving children in our country.","40":"We want money to get bread and milk. That is all...","41":"I see... No, I said something uncalled for. I'd be grateful if you would forget it.","42":"...Then, excuse me.","43":"General Nikalaf, it has been a long time.","44":"Ohh, Lord Saias. We have been awaiting you!","45":"So, how goes the battle?","46":"The enemy's attack is fiercer than expected, and we are having a little trouble.","47":"But now that Lord Saias, hailed even as a god of war, has come, the soldiers' morale will soar at once!","48":"Has Lord Reinhardt's Gelben Ritter not yet arrived?","49":"They will break through the enemy's rear guard and arrive shortly.","50":"Then let us move to an all-out attack. Please convey as much to the Silessean mercenary army as well.","51":"Sir, understood!!","52":"...How goes the battle?","53":"L-Lord Saias!","54":"...The enemy's attack is fiercer than expected, and we are having a little trouble. General Nikalaf, too... a short while ago...","55":"I see...","56":"But Lord Saias, hailed even as a god of war, has come.","57":"With this, the soldiers' morale will soar at once!","58":"Has Lord Reinhardt's Gelben Ritter not yet arrived?","59":"They will break through the enemy's rear guard and arrive shortly.","60":"Then let us move to an all-out attack. Please convey as much to the Silessean mercenary army as well.","61":"Sir, understood!!","62":"What is this!? The enemy's morale seems to have shot up all at once!","63":"The thing I feared most has happened. Prince, there is not a moment to lose. Quickly, give the order to retreat.","64":"What do you mean? Explain!","65":"Lord Saias, the young court priest of Velthomer and genius strategist, has appeared.","66":"As long as he is on the battlefield, we have no chance of victory.","67":"The Empire had such a person?","68":"He is the son of General Aida, the closest of Emperor Arvis's confidants.","69":"After she met a mysterious death, he was placed in a monastery of Bragi, or so I hear...","70":"...But if we retreat now, we'll lose many soldiers. What on earth should I do...","71":"Good, now is our chance. We'll sweep away the rebels! Put a bridge across the river!","72":"Damn, we've been held up unexpectedly. All right, give all troops the order to charge!","73":"General Muller, what has become of Captain Reinhardt?","74":"He went to Connacht with Princess Ishtar.","75":"I don't know the reason, but the princess was acting strangely. He must have been worried.","76":"Minding the princess with a battle before us? What a problem...","77":"Watch your tongue! That is insolent!!","78":"Sir! My apologies!!","79":"But in truth, it is a problem...","80":"Lord Saias, so you were here!","81":"Princess Ishtar? And even Lord Reinhardt. What has you in such a hurry?","82":"His Highness Julius's condition is strange! He has a high fever... and he is moaning terribly in his sleep!","83":"He has always been weak of body, but it has become especially bad of late. And... the Loptr priests?","84":"I have not let those people near him!","85":"Then not even Lord Manfroy!? Why is that?","86":"You, the court priest, must know that best of all, Lord Saias. Please understand my heart.","87":"...I understand. If I can be of help, I will go. So, where is His Highness Julius?","88":"In my room in Connacht...","89":"I see... Then let us go, Princess Ishtar.","90":"What, Lord Saias has gone to Connacht? This is bad... We'll firm up our defense here. Drop the river bridge!","91":"General Misha, the Empire is a hated enemy for us Silesseans too, isn't it?","92":"So why do you side with them!","93":"I have something I must protect. That is all...","94":"...Something you must protect?","95":"It has nothing to do with you. Go now. The battle is starting.","96":"We have somehow managed to break through the castle gate, but many enemies remain inside the castle.","97":"Lord Leif, do not let your guard down.","98":"Even if it means pushing ourselves somewhat, we have no choice but to settle it in one go.","99":"The lord of the castle, Marquis Gustav, is the man who, as King Bloom's right hand, tormented the people of Leonster.","100":"How many people have lost their lives until now by his order...","101":"Indeed. Slay Gustav and display his head on the castle gate.","102":"Mercy is uncalled for. You must fulfill your duty as a sovereign, Prince!","103":"Lord Leif, we have captured the Silessean commander. What shall we do?","104":"I'd like to meet her. Bring her in.","105":"You are the commander of the Silessean army?","106":"I have no intention of accepting mercy. It is a waste of time; kill me quickly!","107":"Prince, it's no use. The pegasus knights of Silesse prize honor above all.","108":"To have let many subordinates die and then be captured and live on in shame is more than she can bear.","109":"I think the merciful thing here is to let her die as she wishes...","110":"Count Dorias, don't say such foolish things!","111":"Misha, you had something to protect, didn't you?","112":"What good is dying in a place like this!","113":"Don't you feel sorry for the children waiting in Silesse!","114":"! ...How do you know about that?","115":"I heard it from someone who was under your command. She had fallen on the battlefield, and I tried to save her, but...","116":"That's when she told me. I... I didn't know...","117":"That in the places the Empire rules, so many people were starving...","118":"So many children... wasting away... and dying.","119":"So wanting to get food, they became mercenaries for the Empire, she said.","120":"......","121":"Lady Misha, is that not somewhat wrong?","122":"To save the children close to you, it cannot be right to sacrifice the children of another country.","123":"The Empire is hunting children in Thracia. Before long it will begin in Silesse too.","124":"When that time comes, who exactly will protect the children?","125":"Child hunts... What do you mean?","126":"You don't know... Then live a little longer, and look at this reality.","127":"I want you to know our suffering and sorrow!","128":"...I'm sorry... I am a little confused.","129":"Please give me time. I want to think a little more...","130":"Well come. Leonster Castle is vast inside, so you'll have trouble getting scattered about.","131":"Take this Rescue staff with you.","132":"At last we can break free of the Empire's rule. Ahh, it's like a dream...","133":"Please do your best! I'll give you this Warp staff. Drive the Empire out!","134":"Hold on, you're attacking Leonster with gear like that? Are you really all right?","135":"I'll give you this Magic Ring, so at least use this before you go.","136":"I hear there are quite a lot of Loptr types in Leonster Castle. Take this holy water.","137":"......","138":"Now, Sara, where are you going?","139":"......","140":"Oh, are you from the Liberation Army? Did this child say something? Please don't mind it too much.","141":"This child sometimes blurts out strange things... She is a child with something a little mysterious about her.","142":"...Going...","143":"Going? Where to?","144":"...Going... I'm going with this person...","145":"With them, you say, but this person is from an army... Now, Sara, wait!","146":"Going... Take me with you...","147":"As if the likes of you could defeat me! Come on, have at me!","148":"Mmgh... You're... not bad at all... gah!","149":"......","150":"...O god Loptous... to the new age... I offer... this body...","151":"......","152":"Do you mean to get in my way!","153":"Heh... So I, too... am going... to where Mother Deetvar is...","154":"I thank you for sparing me. But I must fight.","155":"Learn well the terror of the Gelben Ritter!","156":"Gah... Absurd... That we should be defeated...","157":"...Naive...","158":"Withdraw... You cannot defeat me..."};
